cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DevKidCC: Developing Kidney Cell Classifier"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the Genome Medicine paper below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sean
    family-names: Wilson
    email: sbwilson91@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8994-0781"
    affiliation: "Murdoch Children's Research Institute"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KidneyRegeneration/DevKidCC"
license: MIT
version: 0.5.1
abstract: >-
  DevKidCC classifies cells in single-cell RNA-seq data of the developing human
  kidney and of kidney organoids into their most likely cell type, using a
  hierarchical set of scPred models trained on a human fetal kidney reference.
  It reads Seurat objects in R and AnnData objects in Python, and is distributed
  as a container carrying both stacks.
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - kidney organoid
  - cell type classification
  - kidney development
  - scPred

preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
